<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Praegitzer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Praegitzer cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded Praegitzer Industries Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- cut the earnings estimate to $0.80 per share from $1.15 for 1997, ending in June, and to $1.10 from $1.38 for 1998.</p>
</text>
